<view class="page with-dock"><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="local-banner">本地演练 · 反馈仅保存在演练数据里</view><view class="eyebrow">把这一顿的心意，留给掌勺的人。</view><view class="title">饭后反馈</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在翻看这一顿…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card"><view>{{error}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view><block wx:elif="{{review}}"><view class="note">只有你和本餐接单厨师能看见你的反馈，不会公开评分。</view><view wx:if="{{!review.available}}" class="card empty">饭局结束且有菜上桌后，就能给厨师留下反馈。</view><block wx:else><view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="line_id"><view class="row"><view class="dish-name">{{item.name}}</view><text class="tag">上桌 {{item.quantity}} 份</text></view><view class="feedback-tags"><button size="mini" class="feedback-tag {{tag.selected?'selected':''}}" wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:for-item="tag" wx:for-index="tagIndex" wx:key="label" data-index="{{index}}" data-tag="{{tagIndex}}" bindtap="tag">{{tag.label}}</button></view><textarea class="textarea short-note" value="{{item.note}}" maxlength="60" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="还想告诉厨师什么？可不填。"/></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">给这一顿留句话</view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{note}}" maxlength="300" bindinput="input" placeholder="谢谢今天掌勺的人，也聊聊下次想怎么吃。"/><view class="muted">每道菜最多选3个标签。保存后仍可修改。</view></view></block><block wx:if="{{review.can_read_all}}"><button class="secondary" bindtap="toggleAll">{{showAll?'收起':'看看'}}朋友们的反馈 · {{review.feedback_total}} 份</button><block wx:if="{{showAll}}"><view wx:if="{{!review.feedback.length}}" class="card empty">还没有朋友留下反馈。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{review.feedback}}" wx:key="index"><view class="dish-name">{{item.name}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="review-note">{{item.note}}</view><view class="friend-line" wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="line" wx:key="line_id"><view>{{line.name}}</view><view class="feedback-tags"><text class="tag" wx:for="{{line.tags}}" wx:for-item="tag" wx:key="*this">{{tag}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{line.note}}" class="muted">{{line.note}}</view></view></view><button wx:if="{{review.feedback.length<review.feedback_total}}" class="secondary" bindtap="loadMore" disabled="{{busy}}">再看看其他反馈</button></block></block></block></view><view wx:if="{{review.available&&!loading}}" class="action-dock"><view class="flex muted">只告诉本餐接单厨师</view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存反馈</button></view>
